      'A lead that gets a reply in minutes converts; one that waits until Monday has already spoken to three competitors. Automation makes the fast reply possible without a team that never sleeps, and the CRM makes sure every conversation is recorded, routed and measured, so the pipeline is something the owner can see rather than something the sales team carries in their heads.',
      'We build these systems for clinics and dental practices, solicitors and accountants, property agencies, education providers, e-commerce brands and B2B companies, with routing rules for how each business actually sells and with reporting that shows the pipeline from enquiry to invoice by source and campaign.',
